  "html": "<p>Here are all the One-Handed Mage weapons.<br/><br/>\n</p><p><small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"2\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Handedness\n</th><th>Type\n</th><th>Speed\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Comment\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Battle_Scepter.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Battle_Scepter.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Battle_Scepter.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Battle_Scepter.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Scepter\" title=\"Battle Scepter\">Battle Scepter</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Ludicrous\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Gnarled_Wand.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Gnarled_Wand.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Gnarled_Wand.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Gnarled_Wand.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Gnarled_Wand\" title=\"Gnarled Wand\">Gnarled Wand</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Ludicrous\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Intricate_Wand.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Intricate_Wand.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Intricate_Wand.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Intricate_Wand.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Intricate_Wand\" title=\"Intricate Wand\">Intricate Wand</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Ludicrous\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Knotty_Rod.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Knotty_Rod.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Knotty_Rod.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Knotty_Rod.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Knotty_Rod\" title=\"Knotty Rod\">Knotty Rod</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Freakin' Fast\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Mermaid_Wand.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Mermaid Wand.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Mermaid Wand.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Mermaid_Wand.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mermaid_Wand\" title=\"Mermaid Wand\">Mermaid Wand</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Ludicrous\n</td><td>Unqiue Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Nether_Scepter.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Nether_Scepter.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Nether_Scepter.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Nether_Scepter.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Nether_Scepter\" title=\"Nether Scepter\">Nether Scepter</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Fast\n</td><td>Unqiue Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Pixie_Duster.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Pixie_Duster.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Pixie_Duster.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Pixie_Duster.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Pixie_Duster\" title=\"Pixie Duster\">Pixie Duster</a>\n</td><td>One-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Ludicrous\n</td><td>Unqiue Only\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Scepter.png\" title=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Scepter.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 1h-weapon-_Scepter.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"96\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Scepter.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Scepter\" title=\"Sce